OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FOutbreaks of rain will spread
OL,6,Fnortheast this morning. This afternoon
OL,7,Fwill be cloudy with rain, occasionally
OL,8,Fheavy. Turning drier from the
OL,9,Fsouthwest later this afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FClear periods and the odd
OL,12,Fshowers this evening. Then the rest of
OL,13,Fthe night will be mainly dry with
OL,14,Fclear periods but one or two showers
OL,15,Facross western Tayside.
OL,16,
OL,17,CMonday:FA mostly dry day with some
OL,18,Fgood spells of sunshine. A few showers
OL,19,Facross western Tayside at first.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
