OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FWindy
OL,6,Fwith patchy rain spreading north later
OL,7,Fon Tuesday. Early rain on Wednesday
OL,8,Fthen bright with the odd shower.
OL,9,FMainly dry and bright on Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
